# There are NO server-side secrets in this project. Nothing here is required.
#
# This project uses bring-your-own-key: the visitor pastes their provider key in
# the browser, and it is sent once in the request body to api/lab.py, used for a
# single upstream call, and discarded. It is never read from Vercel's environment,
# never written to disk, and never logged.
#
# Do NOT add a real key to this file or to any file in the repo.
#
# If you fork this and want your own model provider wired in server-side, add it
# as a Vercel environment variable instead:
#
#   vercel env add MISTRAL_API_KEY production
#
# ...and read os.environ.get("MISTRAL_API_KEY") in api/lab.py. The submitted
# version deliberately does not do this.
